# Dependency jars fetched or supplied locally.
# purejavacomm 0.0.29 is the exception: it is not published to Maven Central under
# any coordinate, so the build cannot resolve it. It is committed here to keep a
# clean clone buildable without a manual step.
libs/*.jar
!libs/.gitkeep
!libs/purejavacomm-0.0.29.jar
